    "html": "\n      <p class=\"context\">Human + agent · illustrative API change</p>\n      <h2>Side chat explores questions.<br>Plan feedback <em>steers changes.</em></h2>\n      <div class=\"conversation-map\">\n        <div class=\"main-thread\">\n          <div class=\"thread-event\"><span class=\"thread-node\"></span><small>RESEARCH</small><strong>Find the API conventions and existing callers.</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"thread-event\"><span class=\"thread-node\"></span><small>ASK QUESTIONS</small><strong>Must existing clients keep the same response?</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"plan-paper\">\n            <span class=\"paper-label\">Review Plan</span>\n            <p>Add optional pagination.<br>Preserve requests without pagination.</p>\n            <div class=\"anchored-line\">Add compatibility tests.</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feedback-return arrival\" style=\"--delay:1.8s\"><span class=\"codicon codicon-refresh\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> Revise plan. Do not implement yet.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"side-thread\">\n          <div class=\"side-question\">\n            <code>/btw</code>\n            <strong>Would a cursor avoid duplicates when the list changes?</strong>\n            <p>Explore the trade-off using the source conversation's context.</p>\n            <small>Separate transcript. Shared workspace.</small>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"margin-comment arrival\" style=\"--delay:1s\">\n            <span class=\"editorial-label\">Comment on the plan</span>\n            <p>\"Add a test for an insertion between page requests.\"</p>\n            <span class=\"control-label\">Submit Feedback <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</span></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"editorial-foot\"><span>Bring the conclusion back explicitly.</span><span>Pending feedback blocks approval.</span></div>\n    ",
