    "title": "Session orchestration lets one session start and steer others.",
    "html": "\n      <p class=\"context\">Session orchestration · built into VS Code</p>\n      <h2>Session orchestration lets one session<br>start and <em>steer others.</em></h2>\n      <div class=\"delegation-composition\">\n        <div class=\"delegation-request\">\n          <span class=\"editorial-label\">Your request</span>\n          <blockquote>Have another session investigate compatibility. Keep implementation in its own worktree.</blockquote>\n          <p>Give each task an objective, a workspace, and a result to return.</p>\n          <div class=\"delegated-work arrival\" style=\"--delay:.4s\">\n            <span><i class=\"status-dot green-dot\"></i><b>Compatibility research</b><small>Findings and file references</small></span>\n            <span><i class=\"status-dot violet-dot\"></i><b>Implementation</b><small>Branch and code changes</small></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"session-operations\">\n          <div><span class=\"codicon codicon-list-tree\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><strong>Find the work</strong><p>List sessions, status, workspaces, and changes.</p></div>\n          <div class=\"arrival\" style=\"--delay:.5s\"><span class=\"codicon codicon-add\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><strong>Start a task</strong><p>Create a session, or a chat within a session.</p></div>\n          <div class=\"arrival\" style=\"--delay:1s\"><span class=\"codicon codicon-comment-discussion\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><strong>Read and follow up</strong><p>Read recent context. Send a targeted message.</p><small class=\"confirmation-label\">Cross-session messages require your confirmation.</small></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"editorial-foot\"><span>A new chat can share a workspace. A new session can have its own.</span><span>Separate conversations do not guarantee separate files.</span></div>\n    ",
