    "html": "\n      <p class=\"context\">Code isolation</p>\n      <h2>Worktrees separate edits.<br>The machine is <em>still shared.</em></h2>\n      <div class=\"worktree-machine\">\n        <span class=\"machine-label\"><span class=\"codicon codicon-device-desktop\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> ONE HOST</span>\n        <div class=\"worktree-pair\">\n          <div class=\"checkout-boundary\"><span class=\"editorial-label\">Worktree A</span><h3><span class=\"codicon codicon-git-branch\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> feat/pagination</h3><div class=\"checkout-file\"><code>src/api.ts</code><span class=\"diff-add\">+ items + cursor</span></div><p>Own checkout, index, and changes</p></div>\n          <div class=\"checkout-boundary alternate-checkout\"><span class=\"editorial-label\">Worktree B</span><h3><span class=\"codicon codicon-git-branch\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> fix/retry</h3><div class=\"checkout-file\"><code>src/api.ts</code><span class=\"diff-add\">+ retry on timeout</span></div><p>Own checkout, index, and changes</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"machine-bus\"><span>Shared CPU + memory</span><span>Shared ports + processes</span><span>No added security boundary</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"editorial-foot\"><span>New Worktree starts from a committed base branch.</span><span>Uncommitted changes and ignored files do not appear automatically.</span></div>\n    ",
