    "html": "\n      <p class=\"context\">Remote Agent Host · your machine, your toolchain</p>\n      <h2>Remote Agent Host runs the build<br>on <em>your DevBox.</em></h2>\n      <div class=\"remote-composition\">\n        <div class=\"supervision-device\"><div class=\"laptop-screen\"><span class=\"codicon codicon-vscode\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><strong>VS Code</strong><p>Prompt · steer · approve<br>Review changes</p></div><div class=\"laptop-base\"></div><small>A browser can connect by tunnel, too.</small></div>\n        <div class=\"remote-link\"><span class=\"codicon codicon-lock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><b>Dev Tunnel</b><div class=\"connection-line\"><i class=\"connection-packet\"></i></div><small>SSH is another option.</small></div>\n        <div class=\"devbox-machine\"><span class=\"editorial-label\">Windows DevBox</span><h3>Agent + build tools</h3><div class=\"devbox-slots\"><span>VS Code checkout</span><span>Builds, tests, terminals</span><span>Host CPU + memory</span></div><p>Execution stays beside the code.</p></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"editorial-foot\"><span>The host must remain powered on and reachable.</span><span>Require tunnel authentication.</span></div>\n    ",
