    "title": "Cloud Sandbox runs the session off your machine.",
    "html": "\n      <p class=\"context\">GitHub-hosted execution · Cloud Sandbox</p>\n      <h2>Cloud Sandbox runs the session<br><em>off your machine.</em></h2>\n      <div class=\"cloud-composition\">\n        <div class=\"cloud-entry\">\n          <span class=\"editorial-label\">Start the session in</span>\n          <h3><span class=\"codicon codicon-vscode\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> VS Code</h3>\n          <h3><span class=\"codicon codicon-github\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> GitHub Copilot App</h3>\n          <p>Choose Cloud Sandbox for a new session.</p>\n          <div class=\"cli-entry\"><span class=\"editorial-label\">Or Copilot CLI</span><code>copilot --cloud --experimental</code></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cloud-environment arrival\" style=\"--delay:.45s\">\n          <span class=\"codicon codicon-cloud\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"editorial-label\">Isolated Linux environment</span>\n          <h3>Session + code + tools</h3><p>GitHub runs the environment.<br>Your laptop does not run the workload.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sandbox-lifecycle\" aria-label=\"Running incurs compute and memory charges. Stopping saves a snapshot with storage charges. Deleting removes the environment and snapshot.\">\n        <div><b>Running</b><span>Compute + allocated memory</span></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8594;</span><div><b>Stopped</b><span>Resume from snapshot. Storage billed.</span></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8594;</span><div><b>Deleted</b><span>Environment + snapshot removed</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"editorial-foot\"><span>Organization policy and a billing owner apply.</span><span>Steer the session from your client. Run the workload on GitHub.</span></div>\n    ",
